      <rules>
        <rule name="Concealment" id="ed45-791e-67ba-f5fd" hidden="false">
          <description>Enemy warriors often find it difficult to detect a Footpad until he strikes.
If an enemy warrior wishes to charge a Footpad that he cannot see (but was not declared as Hidden), he must subtract 1 from his Initiative before making his Initiative test.
Note that a roll of ‘6’ always fails when rolling to charge a Footpad
that the warrior cannot see.
Also, models halve their Initiative when checking the range to see if they can detect a Footpad who has been declared as Hiding.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
